	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "n8Eb4zSsJ4tBsuy2k",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 10, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 9, HP 10, WILL 10, PER 11, FP 9, SPEED 5, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nPc4d2vqntkfHPEEH",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 12 (offense 13, protection -1), threat tier minor, appearing 4."
		},
		{
			"id": "nR-NJn6rkBbmprCIa",
			"text": "Hand Crossbow: Hand Crossbow (13): 1d-1 impaling, Reach Ranged, 100. The bolt barely matters. What matters is what is on it: a target who takes any wound at all rolls against the poison or goes down asleep where they stand."
		},
		{
			"id": "nbOHiCUjwuytrAczq",
			"text": "Racial cost: 89 points of traits plus 32 points of skills."
